          "docs": "<p>Returns information about any jobs for CodePipeline to act on. <code>PollForJobs</code> is valid only for action types with \"Custom\" in the owner field. If the action type contains <code>AWS</code> or <code>ThirdParty</code> in the owner field, the <code>PollForJobs</code> action returns an error.</p> <important> <p>When this API is called, CodePipeline returns temporary credentials for the S3 bucket used to store artifacts for the pipeline, if the action requires access to that S3 bucket for"
